# A tick that aborts (Conformance AB): the World goes on from the state before it, as if
# the aborted tick's input never came. Here the input is an answer of the wrong type to a
# button, which no program can take. Written by Claude on the claude-bugs branch; subject
# to change.
emit Ui.*
test mod Tests

@count: @unit
@count:
    !inc <- Ui.Button(label=$"Increment")                 # 0
    $count <- 0 then $count + 1 on !inc
    Ui.Label(text=$"Count: {$count}")                     # 1
